Use OpenBSD's available ip6stat fields for IPv6 statistics.
Initialize IPv4 routes and clear next hops for direct/loopback routes.
IPv6 route enumeration is unchanged.

Index: dlls/nsiproxy.sys/ip.c
--- dlls/nsiproxy.sys/ip.c.orig
+++ dlls/nsiproxy.sys/ip.c
